"The requested application is not frontmost. Following window and keyboard actions were stopped." = "请求的应用不在前台，后续窗口和键盘操作已停止。";
"The focused window or input element changed during this action. Remaining changes were stopped without restoring focus. An earlier change may already have occurred." = "执行此操作期间，聚焦的窗口或输入元素发生了变化。剩余更改已停止，焦点不会恢复。之前的更改可能已经生效。";
"The focused window or input element is unavailable through Accessibility. Remaining changes were stopped without restoring focus." = "无法通过辅助功能访问聚焦的窗口或输入元素。剩余更改已停止，焦点不会恢复。";
